Thanks — a few quick safety notes first: an SSN is extremely sensitive. Don’t paste the full number into chats or insecure forms unless absolutely required. If you want, keep only the last four digits in messages here. I won’t store or share your SSN, and I won’t email anyone about it unless you explicitly ask.

